Changes in this edition
-----------------------
This edition changes the original: it removes everything that connects to the network, and adds memory upkeep,
Devin support and bot tools as files, follow-up questions between bots, approvals, project workspaces, and
Chinese (zh-CN) support. These changes suit deployments with restricted environments, such as no outbound network access
or limits on which tools a provider may use.
